---
layout: base.njk
title: Apply for a grant
permalink: /apply/
description: A short inquiry to start. If it looks like a fit, we will write back and ask for the rest.
---
<section class="section section--hero">
  <div class="content stack">
    <span class="eyebrow">Apply for a grant</span>
    <h1 class="display">Tell us what needs <em>mending</em>.</h1>
    <p class="lede">A short inquiry to start. If it looks like a fit, we will write back and ask for the rest.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="content">
    <div class="card card--lg" data-apply-card>
      <form class="stack stack--lg" data-apply-form novalidate>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="org">Name of the organization<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <span class="field__hint">As it appears on your 501(c)(3) determination letter.</span>
          <div><input class="field__control" id="org" name="org" type="text" required aria-describedby="org-error"></div>
          <span class="field__error" id="org-error" data-org-error hidden></span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid--form">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="contact">Who should we write to?</label>
            <div><input class="field__control" id="contact" name="contact" type="text"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="email">Email<span class="field__req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <span class="field__hint">Applications are online only, so our reply comes by email.</span>
            <div><input class="field__control" id="email" name="email" type="email" required aria-describedby="email-error"></div>
            <span class="field__error" id="email-error" data-email-error hidden></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="ptype">What is the project?</label>
          <div>
            <select class="field__control" id="ptype" name="ptype">
              <option value="bells">Bells and tower</option>
              <option value="carillon">Electronic carillon</option>
              <option value="organ">Pipe organ</option>
              <option value="glass">Windows and glass</option>
              <option value="arts">Artisan training</option>
              <option value="other">Something else</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="need">Tell us about it</label>
          <span class="field__hint">A few sentences is plenty. What has gone quiet, and what would it take to fix?</span>
          <div><textarea class="field__control" id="need" name="need" rows="5"></textarea></div>
        </div>
        {#- No opt-out (client, 2026-09-17): funded projects are shown on the site, stated once. #}
        <p class="apply__shared">Funded projects are shared on this site: the church, the work, and the people who did it.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <button class="btn btn--lg" type="submit">Send our inquiry</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="card card--lg card--accent" data-apply-success hidden>
      <div class="stack stack--sm stack--start">
        <h2 class="title">Thank you. We have it.</h2>
        <p class="muted m0 prose">A person reads every inquiry, so give us a couple of weeks. If it looks like a fit we will write back and ask for photographs, drawings and estimates.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
